  "description": "ΓåÆ ΓÇ£Best app for sleepΓÇ¥ ΓÇô Reviewed.com\nΓåÆ Named AppleΓÇÖs \"App of the Day\" over 65 times\nΓåÆ ΓÇ£The most positively reviewed app in the history of the Apple StoreΓÇ¥ ΓÇô Business Insider\n\nRelax Melodies is now BetterSleep. ItΓÇÖs the same great app with all the sounds and content you know and love but with a new sleep tracker, sleep recorder and a beautiful new layout. \nSleep better. Feel better.\n\nBetterSleep helps you understand and improve your sleep with its easy-to-use sleep tracker, sleep recorder, premium sleep sounds, amazing stories and soothing guided meditations. Doesn't that sound dreamy?\nLeading doctors, neuropsychologists, and sleep experts recommend BetterSleep . . . and 91% of our listeners say they slept better after using the app for just one week.\n\nPremium Audio Content\nFall asleep easily, sleep soundly, and develop lasting sleep habits, with dreamy soundscapes, narrated sleep stories, hypnosis and meditations that really work, all perfectly tuned to your needs.\n\nSleep Tracker\nTrack your sleep, understand how it works and let us propose actionable ways to improve it.\n\nSleep Recorder \nRecord the sounds you make while you sleep and listen to them when you wake up. BetterSleep identifies when you snore, move around, sleep talk and make other common sounds at night. \n\nSleep Science\nLearn about the science behind your unique sleep needs and discover your personal chronotype.\n\nMore than 300 sleep sounds & music tracks:\nNature sounds\nASMR sounds\nWhite noise\nWater sounds\nMeditation music\nIsochronic brainwaves\nSolfeggio frequencies\nBinaural beats\nHealing music\n3D sounds\n\nMore than 250 meditations & hypnosis:\nRestful sleep\nMilitary method\nStress and anxiety relief\nTinnitus relief\nYoga Nidra\nGratitude\nBetter sleep\nDeep sleep\nNapping\nDreams\nKids\nHeart coherence\nCouples exercises\nTravel\nCooldown\nMorning\n\nMore than 100 SleepTales & stories:\nFairy Tales\nMystery\nSci-fi\nFantasy\nHistory\nKids\nJourney\nMyths and legends\nNon-fiction\n\nAlso featuring:\n\nBedtime reminders: Set one every night for more restful sleep\nTimers: Stop the app after a set amount of time\nFavorites: A section to add your favorite mixes\nPlaylist: Select your favorite content and create your sleep-inducing playlist\nSmart Mix: Make distracting audio loops disappear and enjoy seamless sound mixes\n\n...and lots more!\n\nBetterSleep optionally integrates with the HealthKit to track your sleep\n\nBetterSleep offers in-app purchases including auto-renewable subscriptions to access premium features\n\nBrought to you by Ipnos,\nNeed help with the app? Message our support team via the Help & Support section in the app or by visiting https://support.bettersleep.com\nRead more about our terms and conditions here :\nPrivacy policy: https://www.bettersleep.com/legal/privacy-policy/\nTerms of service: https://www.bettersleep.com/legal/terms-of-service/",
